      <title>Linux vsock Use-After-Free VM Escape (CVE-2025-21756)</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/poc-archive/pocs/binary/2026-05-17_linux-vsock-vm-escape/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
